@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Lay danh sach bai tap dang mo -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap hop le -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop bai cho bai tap 1 hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200477-pixel/rest-api"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo Id -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Nop bai thieu thong tin -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 7. Nop bai vao bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200477-pixel/rest-api"
}
